   "severity": "high",
   "summary": "Battle pause menu lists Resume, Auto battle, Battle log, How to play, Retreat but no Settings, so text size, battle speed, Reduce Motion and the turn timer can't be changed mid-battle (BIBLE 9.0 row 1; checklist X2, P2, M1)",
   "detail": "BIBLE 9.0 row 1: the hamburger opens Resume, Battle log, Settings, Retreat. The built menu has no Settings row (How to play took its place). The accessibility settings a player needs most when a battle is hard to read or too fast (text size, battle speed, Reduce Motion, turn mode and drag timer, colourblind) are out of reach until the battle ends. Fix: add a Settings row that opens the Settings page over the paused battle; How to play stays.",
