   "detail": "Element 'menu' (35,179 132x130) draws a small light-blue disc with tiny lines in its centre, about a quarter of the button's width. BIBLE 9.0 row 1 names it the hamburger. Fix: a plain three-bar hamburger glyph at about 60% of the button (~80 px), white on the button plate, at least 3:1 against it.",
