   "detail": "After a Knight & Barbarian pincer the Battle log held 'Carried: +100 mana to every spell', 'Knight -> Toad: 11', 'Barbarian -> Toad: 33' and nothing for the pincer or its mana, while the billboard said 'PINCER!' and 'Knight & Barbarian - Pincer'. The Back row at the bottom draws a hand icon and an arrow icon side by side. Fix: one arrow icon on Back (filled, outlined, as elsewhere); every billboard line that carries a fact (pincer, mana gained, wave, refusal) also lands in the log.",
